        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2011 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Three-dimensional vascular imaging techniques offer a significant advantage over traditional imaging techniques. Spatial resolution of current state-of-the-art allows sufficient depiction of anatomical detail. Pre-operative planning of complex endovascular procedures is facilitated by state-of-the-art imaging. Cone-beam CT holds great promise in guiding complex endovascular procedures."
